Z||000000||Patrick||09-03-2000||07:37 PM||||<BR>For all Canadian car racing fans, this was a proud day as Canadian <B>Paul Tracy</B> won today's Vancouver Indy race. It had very special meaning as this was the first Indy race held here in Vancouver since fellow Canadian, <B>Greg Moore</B> (who was from this area) died in a horrible race crash late last year. Congratulations to Paul Tracy for winning the race, and for doing it in memory of his buddy Greg.<P> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20000503-1-000487.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20000503-1-000487.html</A> ||||reg||4
