Z||000002||Patrick||09-03-2000||10:14 PM||||<BR>I was fortunate enough to actually be at the race this year. Here's a single frame of video that I shot of Paul Tracy's victory lap.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/VancouverIndy.jpg"> <P>For you Greg...||||reg||14
